WEBVTT

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:16.910
Well, Genzo?

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:19.870
We made it just like you told us!

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:22.580
Okay, the ropes and
the mat are looking good!

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:24.000
I can't wait!

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.660
We get paid for this, right?

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:27.160
I'm all set!

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:30.830
Lots of people are here
to participate in the tournament!

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:35.040
With this many people, we'll have
more than enough for the tournament.

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:36.700
No, not yet!

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:40.120
There's something missing.

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:41.450
Something...

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:46.290
That's it!

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:47.620
Animals!

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:23.950
"Animal x Event"

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:27.500
We need more animal stuff!

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:31.540
No, you can't put animals
into a fighting tournament!

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:34.000
No, it's a must-have!

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:36.160
An absolute must-have!

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:39.910
There he goes again...

00:02:39.910 --> 00:02:43.830
Couldn't we get some
beastmen to fight, then?

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:46.910
It'd get more people talking.

00:02:46.910 --> 00:02:48.660
That's it!

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:50.870
If I can turn beastmen into wrestlers,

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:53.080
I'll be able to touch them all
I want during the matches!

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:56.250
You're thinking of something bad,
aren't you?

00:02:56.250 --> 00:02:58.250
Absolutely not!

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:04.120
But do you know of any beastmen
who might participate?

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:05.870
Hmm...

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:08.040
Oh, miss!

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:10.910
Oh, Genzo!

00:03:10.910 --> 00:03:12.580
Fancy seeing you here.

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:15.620
You're even more beautiful
than ever this morning!

00:03:15.620 --> 00:03:18.660
Your lush coat, your beautiful tail...

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:21.870
I'd love to take you away right now...

00:03:22.950 --> 00:03:25.620
Oh, you mustn't!

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:28.040
Don't look at me that way...

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:30.660
I can't betray my husband.

00:03:30.660 --> 00:03:31.660
Your husband?

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:33.330
Oh, right!

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:34.330
Miss!

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:38.910
I'm on my way to your house right now.

00:03:38.910 --> 00:03:41.540
What are you going to do?

00:03:41.540 --> 00:03:44.830
Is he going to fight my husband
to try and steal me away?

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:46.580
Wait, Genzo!

00:03:46.580 --> 00:03:51.700
Miss, I'm on my way to
your home right now!

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:56.580
I'm home.

00:03:58.080 --> 00:04:00.290
Who are you?

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:06.160
Say something, damn it!

00:04:06.160 --> 00:04:09.870
You can't just walk right
into my house and...

00:04:09.870 --> 00:04:12.750
You're pretty built, huh?

00:04:13.910 --> 00:04:17.750
No! Don't fight over me!

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:19.410
"Over me"?

00:04:20.910 --> 00:04:22.370
You bastard!

00:04:22.370 --> 00:04:25.200
I wondered why she was taking so much
time to pick nits out of her fur

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:26.790
and trim her nails!

00:04:26.790 --> 00:04:31.830
You stole her from me, you philanderer!

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:35.450
I'm not a philanderer. I'm a wrestler.

00:04:36.450 --> 00:04:39.580
What the hell does that mean?

00:04:45.910 --> 00:04:47.620
Take this!

00:04:55.870 --> 00:04:57.500
Not bad.

00:05:00.910 --> 00:05:02.370
I'm not done yet!

00:05:02.370 --> 00:05:05.580
Honey... Genzo...

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:15.330
What's this heat in my chest?
I remember it so well...

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:19.000
I remember!

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:22.450
I felt this when I was trying to make
my way in the world using only my fists.

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:38.620
I lost, huh?

00:05:39.700 --> 00:05:42.700
But you can be a good wrestler.

00:05:42.700 --> 00:05:45.330
Come fight with me.

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:49.540
I remembered something
I'd forgotten, thanks to you.

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:51.200
I'm sorry, honey.

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:54.580
I want to chase that light again.

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:01.040
Honey!

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:04.080
What just happened here?

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:08.080
Bro, it's time to go outside!

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:10.330
You haven't left your room in days!

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:12.870
It's dangerous outside...

00:06:12.870 --> 00:06:14.870
That pervert is there.

00:06:17.660 --> 00:06:19.830
That pervert is out there!

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:23.000
He's changed.

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:27.000
And it's because of that man!

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:29.950
Ever since he met him, he's been...

00:06:32.290 --> 00:06:34.000
Don't worry!

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:38.620
As long as we stay away from
his house, he won't come to us!

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:46.830
What are you doing here?

00:06:46.830 --> 00:06:49.160
Hey! Fluffball!

00:06:49.160 --> 00:06:51.910
What?

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:53.330
Be a pro wrestler!

00:06:53.330 --> 00:06:55.750
A pro wrestler?

00:06:56.330 --> 00:06:58.950
Pro wrestling is
the ultimate martial art!

00:06:58.950 --> 00:07:01.830
The ultimate entertainment!

00:07:01.830 --> 00:07:04.410
Here, look at this flyer.

00:07:04.410 --> 00:07:06.160
Fighting tournament?

00:07:06.160 --> 00:07:09.160
You're telling me to fight you?

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:12.790
No!

00:07:12.790 --> 00:07:14.540
No! No!

00:07:14.540 --> 00:07:16.120
Bro!

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:21.250
Bro's so scared because of him...

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:24.500
Can I be a pro wrestler, too?

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:31.910
Sure.

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:35.540
Genzo, where were you looking
when you made that decision?

00:07:36.120 --> 00:07:41.200
So Misha and the kobold
will be participating!

00:07:41.200 --> 00:07:43.950
I'd like a little more...

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:49.410
Will this do?

00:07:49.410 --> 00:07:51.950
Don't plant them too deep!

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:54.750
Orcs? Planting flowers!

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:58.080
If it ain't the king!

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:00.200
How've you been?

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:02.450
What are you doing?

00:08:02.450 --> 00:08:06.500
We were trying to find something
we could do for the town!

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:08.750
We're going green!

00:08:10.910 --> 00:08:14.370
Will this work?

00:08:14.370 --> 00:08:17.910
Oh, if it isn't the king!

00:08:17.910 --> 00:08:19.250
Hey there.

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:29.950
It smells like the mistress!

00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:35.410
What are you doing?

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:37.370
Genzo! Shigure!

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:40.330
When did you get back?

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:42.290
Just a little!

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:44.950
Hell no! You freeloader!

00:08:44.950 --> 00:08:46.910
You're no better.

00:08:46.910 --> 00:08:49.870
Give it back! Give it back, damn it!

00:08:49.870 --> 00:08:53.790
Nothing good will come of
leaving you home alone.

00:08:53.790 --> 00:08:55.870
You're getting in the ring too!

00:09:02.830 --> 00:09:04.750
What are the orcs doing here?

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:06.160
No idea.

00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:10.450
I see. I never understood
what "pro wrestling" was.

00:09:10.450 --> 00:09:13.040
But it's a type of quest, I see.

00:09:13.040 --> 00:09:17.080
Behold the magic spear Gae Bolg,
sealed within a northern cave!

00:09:17.080 --> 00:09:19.950
With this new weapon, I will defeat--

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:22.870
Don't you dare!

00:09:28.450 --> 00:09:29.870
Things are looking good!

00:09:29.870 --> 00:09:33.120
Oops! Somebody dropped their spear!

00:09:33.870 --> 00:09:37.910
Okay, I'll explain what
pro wrestling is now!

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:40.950
Pro wrestling is the
ultimate martial art,

00:09:40.950 --> 00:09:44.450
where wrestlers battle it out with
all their might in a square ring!

00:09:44.450 --> 00:09:47.830
What makes it wonderful is the
dynamic combination of skills,

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:50.700
constant action, the friendship
between tag partners,

00:09:50.700 --> 00:09:53.160
and connection between the
fans and the fighters...

00:09:54.700 --> 00:09:56.410
Hey, I brought snacks!

00:09:56.410 --> 00:09:59.750
Snacks! They look delicious!

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:01.540
It's just our leftovers.

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:04.200
I'll bring more if you want,

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:04.910
but you'll have to pay for those.

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:07.950
Okay, let's fill up our bellies!

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:07.950
but you'll have to pay for those.

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:21.120
Hero... Where could you have gone?

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:22.910
Princess Altena!

00:10:22.910 --> 00:10:25.080
There you are!

00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:26.660
What is it?

00:10:26.660 --> 00:10:29.540
Look at this!

00:10:32.910 --> 00:10:34.540
This technique!

00:10:35.370 --> 00:10:37.250
How about we put the names
of our sponsors on the ring

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:40.790
and the fighters' clothing,
and charge a fee?

00:10:40.790 --> 00:10:45.580
Okay! We can charge them for better
spots for their food stalls, too!

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:48.540
We'll be doing live sparring
today, same as the real thing.

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:50.410
All right!

00:10:53.200 --> 00:10:55.120
I'll fight you.

00:11:06.910 --> 00:11:08.910
I've got more left in me!

00:11:08.910 --> 00:11:10.950
Another drink!

00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:16.290
I tried to hold back, but...

00:11:16.290 --> 00:11:18.700
I won't lose next time!

00:11:18.700 --> 00:11:20.870
Hanako, you're strong!

00:11:20.870 --> 00:11:24.290
You too! Your stomach looks delicious!

00:11:24.290 --> 00:11:27.620
Mistress, if you don't wipe off
that sweat you'll catch cold.

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:30.370
Go change, and then
give me those clothes!

00:11:37.950 --> 00:11:39.950
I'm not satisfied.

00:11:46.200 --> 00:11:49.290
There's more to being
a wrestler than just fighting.

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:53.410
You need to follow the rules of
the sport, and keep it entertaining!

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:56.200
Who cares, as long as
the crowd is into it?

00:11:56.200 --> 00:11:58.330
No, it's necessary!

00:11:58.330 --> 00:12:00.330
Absolutely necessary!

00:12:00.330 --> 00:12:02.120
What a pain.

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:07.000
Genzo!

00:12:07.000 --> 00:12:09.790
Look at all the food!

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:14.000
I think Shigure set up
a stall of her own.

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:15.370
Let's go!

00:12:16.950 --> 00:12:18.910
Oh, Genzo!

00:12:18.910 --> 00:12:20.910
What's wrong?

00:12:20.910 --> 00:12:22.330
You look tired.

00:12:22.330 --> 00:12:25.200
I've been busy teaching
people how to wrestle,

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:27.830
and getting ready for the tournament...

00:12:28.580 --> 00:12:29.540
Take this!

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:31.330
Knowing how to take a hit
is part of the sport!

00:12:31.330 --> 00:12:34.290
Endure the pain! Enduring the
pain is part of the sport!

00:12:34.290 --> 00:12:37.540
You didn't train hard enough!

00:12:40.540 --> 00:12:43.330
Listen! This is pro wrestling!

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:48.040
I also wrote a script
for the announcers...

00:12:48.040 --> 00:12:51.620
It reminded me of when I just got
started and had to do grunt work...

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:53.540
Sounds rough...

00:12:53.540 --> 00:12:57.870
Shigure, are you selling any food?

00:12:57.870 --> 00:13:00.330
We only sell merchandise.

00:13:02.450 --> 00:13:04.160
I see.

00:13:04.160 --> 00:13:07.000
Is it that much of a problem?

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:12.120
You sure do know how
to make a buck, though.

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:16.040
I have a lot of freeloaders to take
care of, so I need to make some cash.

00:13:16.040 --> 00:13:19.830
Genzo! That fried dark
tiger meat looks delicious.

00:13:19.830 --> 00:13:21.910
You're still going to eat?!

00:13:23.540 --> 00:13:24.830
Now!

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:29.950
What have you got with muscles?

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:32.450
I've got just the thing for you...

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:38.080
What wonderful muscles!

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:41.160
This is a limited print run,
so there aren't a lot of them.

00:13:41.160 --> 00:13:42.410
I can't afford it!

00:13:42.410 --> 00:13:45.290
But if I don't buy it I'll regret it!

00:13:50.290 --> 00:13:56.370
Bro, I'll defeat that pervert
and avenge you, okay?

00:13:59.080 --> 00:14:00.410
Go!

00:14:00.410 --> 00:14:02.120
Get 'em!

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:10.540
I wanted to fight, too.

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:14.620
You tried to eat the kobold and got kicked out!

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:16.830
The orcs are trying
to win with raw power,

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:19.160
while the hunters want
to win with technique.

00:14:19.160 --> 00:14:21.500
Let's ask our commentator
Hanako for her opinion.

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:28.540
Well, orc meat isn't very tasty, with
the exception of the shoulder meat!

00:14:28.540 --> 00:14:32.620
I recommend just adding a little salt
so you can enjoy the natural flavor!

00:14:38.700 --> 00:14:42.040
One, two, three!

00:14:43.910 --> 00:14:45.620
What was that?

00:14:45.620 --> 00:14:47.620
That was an amazing fight,
wasn't it Hanako?

00:14:47.620 --> 00:14:52.370
Yes, but I hope the next round
of fighters will be tastier.

00:14:52.370 --> 00:15:00.000
In the red corner, the kobold man!

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:02.620
His passionate blood has revived!

00:15:02.620 --> 00:15:09.580
And in the blue corner, Celes XXL!

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:14.080
Back to the lizardman! The match
everyone's been waiting for!

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:16.040
The crowd is getting into it.

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:18.410
Word has been spreading
since the match started,

00:15:18.410 --> 00:15:20.080
and we're selling lots
of same-day tickets.

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:22.000
It's a big success!

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:23.580
I'm not satisfied.

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:27.830
We're missing the drama and rivalries
that make pro wrestling exciting!

00:15:27.830 --> 00:15:30.370
I never understand a word you say...

00:15:30.370 --> 00:15:33.250
Even without that, it's very exciting!

00:15:33.250 --> 00:15:35.000
No, it's necessary!

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:38.540
Rivalries and drama are
an absolute necessity!

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:41.580
Genzo turns into a giant pain
whenever animals or

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:43.620
pro wrestling is involved...

00:15:52.790 --> 00:15:54.250
One, two, three!

00:15:57.000 --> 00:15:58.910
Hey, that was too fast!

00:15:58.910 --> 00:16:02.830
Celes XXL wins with a huracanrana!

00:16:02.830 --> 00:16:04.410
What do you think?

00:16:04.410 --> 00:16:09.290
Kobold muscles have slow reaction times,
but they're very tight and juicy!

00:16:09.290 --> 00:16:13.500
I recommend the thigh meat!
Grind it up and make it into hamburgers!

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:16.290
Now, the sky has begun to
darken for some reason,

00:16:16.290 --> 00:16:19.250
but it's time for our main event!

00:16:19.250 --> 00:16:20.450
Is it time?

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:26.290
In the red corner is Vanstein Carmilla!

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:29.370
Something's missing!
Her beauty's going to waste!

00:16:29.370 --> 00:16:34.120
Genzo Shibata!

00:16:34.120 --> 00:16:39.410
It's the messenger of love and animals,
and a total weirdo!

00:16:39.410 --> 00:16:41.660
It may look like Beauty and the Beast,

00:16:41.660 --> 00:16:45.000
but it's actually the
beast and the beast!

00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:48.200
So you're a man after all, Genzo!

00:16:48.200 --> 00:16:51.750
You made me your tag partner
because I'm so attractive.

00:16:52.620 --> 00:16:54.580
You were just so unpleasant to deal with

00:16:54.580 --> 00:16:57.200
that nobody else would partner with you.

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:58.450
What?

00:16:58.450 --> 00:17:03.410
And in the blue corner, Heat Haze!

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:05.370
Mr. Sandbag himself!

00:17:07.700 --> 00:17:12.540
Misha! The tomboy catgirl herself!

00:17:12.540 --> 00:17:15.250
I'm here for vengeance!

00:17:15.660 --> 00:17:18.000
Get 'em, Misha!

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:26.330
Clause, have you taken
a liking to pro wrestling?

00:17:26.330 --> 00:17:29.370
No, of course not.

00:17:30.700 --> 00:17:32.870
I'll go first.

00:17:32.870 --> 00:17:37.040
I'm taking back the title of the
guild's top fighter, demon beast killer!

00:17:37.040 --> 00:17:40.750
Who are you calling
the demon beast killer?

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:42.620
Genzo!

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:45.700
Okay, go!

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:49.580
Oops! My leg slipped!

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:53.580
That was an accident!
Very clearly an accident!

00:17:53.580 --> 00:17:56.910
That was absolutely deliberate!

00:17:56.910 --> 00:17:58.620
I have no idea what
you're talking about...

00:17:58.620 --> 00:18:00.200
What?

00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:02.660
Looks like they're fighting among themselves!

00:18:02.660 --> 00:18:03.540
Now!

00:18:03.540 --> 00:18:04.700
Right!

00:18:14.410 --> 00:18:16.080
Hey, hey, hey!

00:18:26.370 --> 00:18:29.500
I knew I couldn't avenge him...

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:32.370
One, two...

00:18:35.910 --> 00:18:39.910
That's Gang! It's you, Gang!

00:18:40.500 --> 00:18:42.660
Bro!

00:18:42.660 --> 00:18:45.040
You came!

00:18:45.040 --> 00:18:47.700
No, I...

00:18:47.700 --> 00:18:49.870
A new combatant is about
to enter the ring!

00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:52.500
What's your take, Hanako?

00:18:52.500 --> 00:18:53.830
A werewolf...

00:18:53.830 --> 00:18:57.160
Their meat is chewy and nutritious.

00:18:57.160 --> 00:19:01.700
You can use it in a stew,
but I prefer it smoked.

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:05.870
On behalf of the event's sponsors,
I request a replacement.

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:15.540
A new challenger has entered
the ring! Wolfgang the wolfman!

00:19:16.370 --> 00:19:18.290
Bro!

00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:22.620
Wolfgang! Wolfgang! Wolfgang! Wolfgang!

00:19:22.620 --> 00:19:24.330
This excitement!

00:19:24.330 --> 00:19:26.580
Is this rivalry and drama?

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:28.790
Some of you may know him...

00:19:28.790 --> 00:19:33.910
Yes, this is the man who was hit by
Genzo's giant swing, and was easily defeated!

00:19:33.910 --> 00:19:37.160
He was traumatized!
But today, things are different!

00:19:37.160 --> 00:19:39.160
He's overcome his past traumas!

00:19:39.160 --> 00:19:42.830
Behold, this is a new dawn for him!

00:19:42.830 --> 00:19:45.250
Welcome, fluffball!

00:19:46.250 --> 00:19:50.200
Bro, together, we won't lose to anyone!

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:51.870
No, I...

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:54.830
Bring it!

00:20:01.370 --> 00:20:06.000
I'm about to rub your fur
all over again!

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:08.370
Stop it!

00:20:08.370 --> 00:20:10.620
Rub, rub, rub!

00:20:10.620 --> 00:20:13.370
No! Stop the match!

00:20:13.370 --> 00:20:16.200
E-Everybody's watching!

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:24.250
"Genzo, Carmilla
vs
Wolfgang von Cratman, Misha"
"17 Minutes 26 Seconds"  "Furry Cobra Twist"

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:27.290
Cheers...!

00:20:27.290 --> 00:20:29.950
Cheers!

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:32.330
Well done, everyone!

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:34.450
Eat up, and drink up!

00:20:39.370 --> 00:20:42.950
Genzo, the event was a huge success.

00:20:42.950 --> 00:20:45.910
Maybe not that last match...

00:20:45.910 --> 00:20:50.700
But since we made so much,
we can pay out a lot of fight money!

00:20:50.700 --> 00:20:53.950
Yes! We're a step closer
to our pet shop!

00:21:01.620 --> 00:21:04.950
It kind of makes you feel warm.

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:08.700
So this is what Genzo wants, isn't it?

00:21:09.410 --> 00:21:10.750
Shigure...

00:21:10.750 --> 00:21:12.410
Yes?

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:14.080
Time to pay out.

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:20.700
What the hell is this?

00:21:20.700 --> 00:21:23.620
The bills for repairing all the stalls
and buildings wrecked during practice,

00:21:23.620 --> 00:21:27.700
all the alcohol Carmilla drank,
all the food Hanako ate,

00:21:27.700 --> 00:21:30.620
the money to pay the baker for
all that bread everyone ate,

00:21:30.620 --> 00:21:32.120
the post-game party, the fight money...

00:21:32.120 --> 00:21:35.540
It all wiped out every cent
I earned from my stall!

00:21:35.540 --> 00:21:37.330
We're sorry.

00:21:37.330 --> 00:21:41.790
We're back to salty water soup
and salted potatoes tomorrow.

00:21:41.790 --> 00:21:42.870
Yes ma'am!

00:23:17.080 --> 00:23:20.580
The hero has been here for a while.

00:23:20.580 --> 00:23:23.830
He's probably formed a powerful party.

00:23:23.830 --> 00:23:27.750
He was strong in tag matches too, yeah.

00:23:27.750 --> 00:23:31.410
We should try to strengthen
our forces to fight him.

00:23:31.410 --> 00:23:33.370
Got any ideas?

00:23:33.370 --> 00:23:37.660
Yes. Make the demon beasts obey us.

00:23:37.660 --> 00:23:40.120
Demon beasts?

00:23:40.120 --> 00:23:42.250
Animals, huh?

00:23:46.290 --> 00:23:49.790
Next Time: "Princess x Panties."
